text I wonder how I'm going to feel if I ever find myself in the same place as him...
text Will I have any regrets by then?
text If I do...
text I just might start regretting all of the time I've ever spent alive.
text For now, all I can do is believe in myself.
text Even if it means coming to regret my actions later...
text I'm sure I'll be able to get over it as long as Nagisa is there.
text So let's go.
text Just the two of us.
