text When I see my father on the other side of the glass... he practically looks like a prisoner.
text He's only been accused, not convicted of anything yet.
text @[Father]
text ...
text His expression is mild, like it always is.
text He doesn't even flinch in front of me.
text And that's why I can't forgive him.
text I want him to panic and bow to me.
text I want him to beg for my forgiveness.
text For what he's done now... And everything he's done over the last ten years.
text @[Father]
text ...
text But... he stays silent.
text So I decide to speak first.
text @[Tomoya]
text You...
text @[Tomoya]
text What is it you're trying to do...?
text I can't stop my voice from trembling.
text @[Tomoya]
text Do you find it that much fun to mess up other peoples' lives...?
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't even think of you as a parent...
text @[Tomoya]
text But the world doesn't see things the same way.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm your son, you see...
text @[Tomoya]
text The son of a criminal...
text @[Father]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Do you not even feel like talking...?
text @[Tomoya]
text You don't have anything to say to the son who you've caused all this trouble for?
text @[Tomoya]
text Cu...
text @[Tomoya]
text Cut me a damn break!
sound NGO.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun!
text I feel a warm hand touch my back.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm done...
text @[Tomoya]
text There's nothing more for me to say here...
text @[Tomoya]
text Just live here trapped for the rest of your life.
text I spit the words out as I turn away.
